  "Question": "In \\(\\triangle ABC\\), \\(AD\\) is the median to side \\(BC\\). How do the areas of \\(\\triangle ABD\\) and \\(\\triangle ACD\\) compare?",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "The area of \\(\\triangle ABD\\) is greater",
